{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1549338-looking-for-advice-on-abilities-or-disciplines-that-target-intelligence-or-willpower","id":1549338,"title":"Looking for advice on abilities or Disciplines that target Intelligence or Willpower.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2025-03-15T07:52:54-07:00","id":1549338,"title":"Looking for advice on abilities or Disciplines that target Intelligence or Willpower.","content":"I\u2019ve been trying to read over sourcebooks for Disciplines, combo-Disciplines or other abilities for reducing a targets Willpower or Intelligence. <br /> I have probably overlooked things, thats why i\u2019m looking for any suggestions or advice.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28559-malachy","name":"Malachy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar28559_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":1,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-03-15T11:28:32-07:00","id":1549342,"title":"","content":"I think Dementation, Daimonion, the Path of Phobos in Dark Thaumaturgy, and the Revelations of Eden (VDA20 Tome of Secrets) have some powers of this kind. Maybe also the Path of Haunting from VDA20 Necromancy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/16965-hermeticus","name":"Hermeticus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"431"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-03-16T00:31:52-07:00","id":1549353,"title":"","content":"The &quot;best&quot; is the Dark Thaumaturgy Path called:<br /> <br /> <b>Taking of the Spirit </b>(From Guide to the Sabbat and Rites of the Blood )<br /> Saps the willpower of the victim. Instead of distinct powers, each level of mastery allows the practitioner to strip Willpower for more extended periods of time from a target.<br /> *1 Willpower Point<br /> **2 Willpower Points<br /> ***4 Willpower Points<br /> ****6 Willpower Points<br /> ***** 8 Willpower Points<br /> <br /> I mean you can't go harder than this when it comes to Willpower<br /> For Intelligence it is a Level 7 Dementation power called:<br /> <br /> <b>Mind of a Child</b> (The Players Guide to the Sabbat; <b>Minds of the Children</b> is Level 8 and like <b>Mind of a Child</b>\u200b, except affect multiple targets)<br /> This power allows the vampire to reduce the victim's total Mental Attributes by up to seven points, as long as the person is left with at least one point in each of the three Attributes.<br /> The victim also becomes very childlike in manner, acting both gullible and playful.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23890-shadeprowler","name":"Shadeprowler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23890_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"928"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-03-16T07:24:10-07:00","id":1549359,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shadeprowler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1549338-looking-for-advice-on-abilities-or-disciplines-that-target-intelligence-or-willpower?p=1549353#post1549353\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The &quot;best&quot; is the Dark Thaumaturgy Path called:<br /> <br /> <b>Taking of the Spirit </b>(From Guide to the Sabbat and Rites of the Blood )<br /> Saps the willpower of the victim. Instead of distinct powers, each level of mastery allows the practitioner to strip Willpower for more extended periods of time from a target.<br /> *1 Willpower Point<br /> **2 Willpower Points<br /> ***4 Willpower Points<br /> ****6 Willpower Points<br /> ***** 8 Willpower Points<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Ah right, this is the Path I meant. Path of Phobos is the wrong name.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/16965-hermeticus","name":"Hermeticus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"431"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-03-18T15:19:57-07:00","id":1549419,"title":"","content":"Thank you. I will keep looking and take these into account.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28559-malachy","name":"Malachy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar28559_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":1,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}